{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>The blessings of your father.</b> These blessings with which I have blessed you are mighty, and they are joined with the blessings of my parents who blessed me," "and הורי [my parents] is like יולדי [my begetters]. Similarly, ותהר את מרים (1 Chronicles 4:17); 'הורה גבר' (Job 3:3)." "<b>תאות [desire].</b> From the root of והתאויתם (Numbers 11:4 [sic]). The meaning is that the blessings will lift them up." "<b>נזיר אחיו [the Nazirite of his brothers].</b> From the root of נזר, and it is in construct state, like נדיב לב (Exodus 35:22)."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:48:37.142342194Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}